Canonical migration notes for this repo:

- Run migrations using the project venv:
  `./backend/migrate.sh upgrade head`
- Optional DB override example:
  `DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/dbname ./backend/migrate.sh upgrade head`
- If you are debugging schema state:
  `./backend/migrate.sh current`
- Revert to previous migration revision:
  `./backend/migrate.sh downgrade -1`

The migration wrapper ensures the project import path is set consistently and avoids picking
up a globally installed Alembic/binary set that does not share the project environment.
